{"type":"message","id":"380b30cb","parentId":"3871298c","timestamp":"2026-02-26T13:36:25.309Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-02-26 21:36 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 请让你的团队成员分别介绍一下自己。根据它们各自的 SOUL.md 角色定位，用第一人称介绍各自的职责和能力。"}],"timestamp":1772112985307}}
{"type":"message","id":"3b1180ed","parentId":"380b30cb","timestamp":"2026-02-26T13:36:39.581Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户让我作为 leader-agent，让团队成员分别介绍一下自己。我需要查看各个团队成员的 SOUL.md 文件来了解他们的角色定位，然后用第一人称介绍各自的职责和能力。\n\n根据 SOUL.md，我的团队成员包括：\n- search-agent — 研究和信息收集\n- design-agent — 架构和系统设计\n- code-agent — 代码实现\n- test-agent — 测试和质量保证\n- docs-agent — 文档\n- review-agent — 代码审查\n\n我需要先读取这些代理的 SOUL.md 文件来了解他们的具体角色定位。让我先查看工作区中是否有这些代理的目录。","thinkingSignature":"e2d83beb5903418345061b854faf5dea4a05651aec945262c7ee7060df363f36"},{"type":"text","text":"我来查看团队成员的 SOUL.md 文件，了解他们的角色定位。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_a4nrw3d6j4ye_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/one/.openclaw/agents/"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":4,"output":171,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":7724,"totalTokens":7899,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772112985309}}
